1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,160
An Amateur Journalist.
业余记者。

2
00:00:04,160 --> 00:00:45,020
Jane is a housewife, but delighted to work as an amateur journalist. It is a dilemma for her to rush between family and work, and it is also unusual for the News Department to depend on an amateur to cover crimes. But Jane is really gifted.
简是一位家庭主妇，但她很乐意做一名业余记者。在家庭和工作之间来回奔波，让她左右为难，而对于新闻部门来说，依靠业余人员报道犯罪案件也很不寻常。但简确实很有天赋。

3
00:00:45,020 --> 00:01:34,980
It is admirable that she is seldom accused of making mistakes. And, eager to become more professional, she concentrates on her job and updates herself now and then. Once she is informed of a new case, her normal working process is as follows: first, she makes appointments with guilty people for interviews.
令人佩服的是，她很少因出错而受到指责。她渴望变得更加专业，因此专注于工作，不时学习新东西。一旦接到新案件的消息，她通常按以下流程工作：首先，她预约采访涉案的犯罪者。

4
00:01:34,980 --> 00:02:13,807
So as to acquire accurate stories, she usually demands to record what they say. Meanwhile, a technically good colleague will assist her in taking photographs. Second, she assesses whether they are deliberately hiding the truth.
为了获得准确的报道素材，她通常要求录下，他们所说的话。与此同时，一位技术出色的同事会协助她拍照。其次，她评估他们是否故意隐瞒真相。

5
00:02:13,807 --> 00:03:00,133
If she is skeptical about their words, she will look into the case herself. Third, she writes thorough stories ahead of the deadline and submits them to the senior chief editor, who polishes and approves every section. Finally, her stories will be published in different editions of their magazine.
如果她对他们的话有所怀疑，就会亲自调查案件。第三，她在截稿日期前写出详尽的报道，提交给资深主编，由主编润色并批准每一个部分。最后，她的报道会刊登在杂志的不同期次中。
